      <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
      <section id="appeal-checklist" class="pillar-section" aria-labelledby="h2-checklist">
        <div class="summary-checklist">
          <p class="checklist-title" id="h2-checklist">Your Medicare Problem Resolution Checklist</p>
          <ul class="checklist-list">
            <li>Review your Medicare Summary Notice (MSN) or plan EOB to verify the exact denial code</li>
            <li>Request a formal Letter of Medical Necessity from your treating physician</li>
            <li>Submit your written Level 1 appeal within 60 calendar days of the denial notice</li>
            <li>Demand an expedited (72-hour) review if your health could be harmed by waiting</li>
            <li>Check your hospital bills using our <a href="/tools/hospital-bill-line-item-checker/">Hospital Bill Line-Item Checker</a> before making payments</li>
            <li>Contact a free, unbiased SHIP counselor at <a href="https://www.shiphelp.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">shiphelp.org</a> for one-on-one appeal assistance</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
